.cache/
.hypothesis/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
# uv.lock IS committed (reproducible installs); _generated/ IS committed (drift-checked).

# CDK synth output (build artifact — regenerated by `cdk synth`)
ops/cdk/cdk.out/
!.env.example

# dev.sh local run logs
.dev-logs/

# 배치 스크래치 — arXiv id 목록·중간 산출물. 측정 기록(심판 결과 등)은 개별로 추적한다.
reports/restale-*.txt
reports/reparse-*.txt
reports/*-targets.txt
